## Link directory CMS (production edits)

Operators can also create sites/opportunities in **secret-admin** without new seeds: `web/src/lib/ui/components/link-directory-manager/` (e.g. `LinkDirectoryOpportunityUpsertModal.svelte` — `dofollow`, cost, steps). Seeds remain the source of truth for **dev/staging exemplars** and CI aggregates.

