## PR checklist

Use as the execution list.

**Link directory (catalog)**

- [ ] `link_directory_sites` seed (or CMS) with slug, URLs, descriptions, tags
- [ ] `link_directory_opportunities` per variant: `dofollow`, `cost_tier`, `cost_note`, `steps`, CTA; `auto_launch_enabled` + `auto_launch_provider_slug` when extension ships
- [ ] Site/opportunity copy accurate vs live directory pricing and terms (**source-project-neutrality**)

**Auto-launch (executable)**

- [ ] `auto_launch_destinations` row: unique `provider_slug`, `start_url`, `is_published`, `sort_order`, full `extension_config`
- [ ] `link_directory_opportunity_id` FK set; opportunity slugs stable for idempotent seeds
- [ ] Aggregated migrations regenerated (`aggregate_migrations_all.mjs`)

**Extension**

- [ ] `pageAssist.ts` provider entry
- [ ] `extension/src/content/directory-launch/<slug>.ts` + build script + manifest `content_scripts`
- [ ] Extension build verified; handoff opens `start_url` (and optional tab from `openDirectoryLaunchStartUrl`)

**Web & profile**

- [ ] Composer / validation cover every required `profilePath` in config
- [ ] Add Channel tile: bundled SVG + `branded-icons` + `buildDirectoryAddChannelTiles` when logo should not depend on remote `logo_url`
- [ ] Readiness hints and directory launch badges behave (`directoryLaunchPickerLabels`, card VM tests updated)

**Tests & docs**

- [ ] Unit tests above updated or added for new slug / paths
- [ ] `extension-ui-patterns.md` mapping + smoke test checklist
- [ ] Manual smoke: Account → My Products → create/edit profile → Launch → fill → mark complete; card `submitted` count increments

## Reference implementations

| Site | Provider slugs (v1) | Start URLs |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Uneed | `uneed-join-line`, `uneed-paid-launch`, `uneed-maker-profile` | `uneed.best/pricing`, pricing, `/` |
| PeerPush | `peerpush-free-queue`, `peerpush-standard-launch` | `peerpush.com/pricing`, `peerpush.com/submit` |

## Do not

- Edit aggregated `backend/supabase/migrations/*_core_structure.sql` directly
- Reuse `safari-pinned-tab` or favicon traces as product logos; use real marks under `web/static/icons/link-directory/`
- Set `dofollow` to `unknown` on paid listing paths when catalog copy already promises a normal website link (fix seed + ON CONFLICT update)
- Add a `provider_slug` without registering it in **both** `pageAssist.ts` and extension build/manifest
- Confuse **site slug** (`peerpush`) with **provider slug** (`peerpush-standard-launch`) in seeds or tests
- Ship a new destination without updating readiness/docs smoke expectations for published destination count
